cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the DRMD AI Generator, please cite the version you used with the metadata in this
  file.
type: software
title: "DRMD (Digital Reference Material Document) AI Generator"
version: 1.0.0
license: EUPL-1.2
repository-code: "https://github.com/BAMresearch/drmd-generator"
url: "https://bamresearch.github.io/drmd-generator/"
authors:
  - family-names: Arumilli
    given-names: Punith Durga Prasad
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-1165-9000"
    affiliation: "Bundesanstalt für Materialforschung und -prüfung (BAM)"
abstract: >-
  A single HTML page that creates Digital Reference Material Documents (DRMD), the XML format for
  reference material certificates and product information sheets aligned with ISO 33401:2024. It
  runs in a web browser without installation. A DRMD can be entered by hand, opened and edited, or
  converted from a PDF with an AI model chosen by the user, using the user's own API key. Units are
  written in D-SI, and every document is checked against the DRMD XML Schema and its business rules,
  version 1.0.0.
keywords:
  - reference materials
  - ISO 33401
  - digital certificate
  - PDF conversion
  - D-SI
  - metrology
  - quality infrastructure
